<Paragraph>
In this case, <Replace key="PrimaryCall.name" link="PrimaryLocation"/> is called in <Replace key="PrimaryLocation.file"/> at line <Replace key="PrimaryLocation.line"/>.
</Paragraph>

<b>Example 1:</b> The following code writes an exception to the standard error stream:

<pre>
